          "end": 37.224000000000004,
          "duration": 18.792,
          "until": 37.873999999999995
        },
        {
          "say": "Changing an existing checkpoint's patch width also changes its projection's expected input shape. A supported adaptation and further training may be required. Higher resolution, smaller patches, and later feature merging act at different boundaries. Inspect which operation removes the detail your question needs.",
